<title>BELGIUM: Swissair writeoff could mean Sabena pullout.</title>
<headline>Swissair writeoff could mean Sabena pullout.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair is threatening the possibility of pulling out of Sabena by considering a writeoff of its investment in the Belgin airline, Sabena chief executive Paul Reutlinger said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The threat is to write off the investment but what it means is to have the liberty to take any decision afterwards. (This includes) Swissair walking away,&quot; Reutlinger told Reuters after a news conference.</p>
</text>
